      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZARI EXACT (3) took the sit on the lead from an outside box but levelled up and drew clear to score (22.48) at this track in a Grade 5 over 390m. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Will go close again if runs up to latest. MR. CHIVES (8) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (22.87) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Warrnambool. Key player on best and worth another try. STAR BLUEY (7) had been in great form but was out of the placings last run, finishing sixth (22.98) in a Grade 5 at this track. Normally fast to begin but shuffled back last time. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Likely to play a prominent role. RUPEE ACTION (2) can play a role in the finish without surprising.",
